      "text": "Stage gates:\n\nnode tests/board/test-board-basics.test.mjs\nnode tests/board/markdown-caret-offset-mapping.test.mjs\nnode tests/benchmarks/machine-readability.mjs\n\nRun after any board change. First two must pass; the benchmark is a score, not a gate."
